 width=\"70%\">\n						<p style=\"margin:0;color:#fa591d;font-size:14px\"><strong>Rp 9.900.405</strong></p>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n					<tr style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:10px\">\n						<td style=\"padding:0 0 20px 0\" width=\"30%\">\n						<p style=\"color:rgba(49,53,59,0.68);font-size:12px;margin:0\">Metode Pembayaran</p>\n						</td>\n						<td style=\"padding:0 0 20px 0\" width=\"70%\">\n						<p style=\"margin:0;color:rgba(49,53,59,0.96);font-weight:bold;font-size:14px\"><strong>Transfer</strong></p>\n						</td>\n					</tr>\n					\n                <tr style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:10px\">\n                    <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0\" width=\"30%\">\n                        <p style=\"color:rgba(49,53,59,0.68);font-size:12px;margin:0\">Bank Pembayaran</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0\" width=\"70%\">\n                        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:rgba(49,53,59,0.96);font-weight:bold;font-size:12px\"><strong>BCA</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:10px\">\n                    <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0\" width=\"30%\">\n                        <p style=\"color:rgba(49,53,59,0.68);font-size:12px;margin:0\">Nama Rekening</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0\" width=\"70%\">\n                        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:rgba(49,53,59,0.96);font-weight:bold;font-size:12px\"><strong>JP Buana</strong></p>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:10px\">\n                    <td width=\"30%\">\n                        <p style=\"color:rgba(69,73,79,0.68);font-size:12px;margin:0\">No. Rekening</p>\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"70%\">\n                        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:rgba(49,53,59,0.96);font-weight:bo